# HTTP Presentation Rules

- Use one controller per HTTP action.
- Controllers receive `HttpRequest` and return `HttpResponse`.
- Controllers must not import `FastifyRequest` or `FastifyReply`.
- Validate HTTP input with Zod schemas in `presentation/http/**/validators`.
- Convert Zod errors with `makeValidationError`.
- Register Fastify routes in `main/routes`.
- Adapt Fastify handlers with `main/adapters/fastify-route.adapter.ts`.
- Create controller factories in `main/factories/presentation`.
- Keep request/response translation in presentation; keep business orchestration in application use cases.
